{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_12fce_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_12fce_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "一些选择",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_12fce_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3dd179c5007c5d4305713dd34b44bb3fdbdde6d66f7797d32c8eedb3da77a8cc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你不应当跟着我。\n在我前去的地方有永不停息的战火。\n你只是累赘而已，没必要自寻死路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萨弗拉，你怎么还杵在那，嫌命太长吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*萨卡兹粗口*，快找个掩体蹲下，炮火来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "咳，咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哟，还活着吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "还好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里的狙击点暴露了，时间不多，现在马上转移！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么快又再来？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊啊，该死！我的小腿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "（施展法术）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "这边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳，谢了兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "只不过是利用一下掩体，举手之劳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "腿还好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小问题，不知道受过多少次这样的小伤了。包扎一下就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不说我，兄弟你也不像很能打的样子，竟能撑到现在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看你用源石技艺挪动掩体来掩护的样子，手法老道啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这是第几次上战场了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "虽然做过不少训练，但是这还是第一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "到现在也全凭运气，不是什么大不了的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你还挺谦虚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过说真的，再这么僵持下去可不是个办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上头的人倒是轻松，但我们这可吃不消啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看来这里就我们俩了，不知道其他人如何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "我和其他人失散了......原本的突袭任务失败了，敌人冲散了我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "前面一点动静都没了，看来冲到前方的队员都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧，那可真是巧，我也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经不指望他们能回来帮我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "就算是任务失败了，我可不准备在这里倒下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "我去四周侦察下，一定有逃出包围圈的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "侦察？你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不是看不起你，兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我敢保证，不管你的源石技艺能帮你制造多少掩体，只要你的白色脑袋晃悠出去，对面的炮火马上就能把你炸得稀烂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还不如我们先在这里观望观望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "那可不成......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "三点钟方向......有敌人来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "该死的库兰塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "对面的是轻装库兰塔佣兵。虽然可能还有其他敌人......通常会协同作战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "等他们冲过来，就没地方能逃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "可能还配备了术师无人机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你，怎么知道得这么清楚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "简单的推断，猜测，经验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "可能有猜错的，但是大致如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "虽然现在出去可能比较醒目，但是我们的位置躲不了多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道得这么清楚，那岂不是你也能轻松干掉他们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "凭我的源石技艺可做不到，估计一出手就会被敌人解决掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "对我来说，只是逃跑就已经拼尽全力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈看来雇你来上战场的雇主也是看走了眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打败仗的原因竟然是太抠门只能雇来这样的士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......之前没来得及问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萨弗拉，你叫什么名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "我的名字很多，现在叫我46A就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，这个是名字么？听上去像是什么家用电器的编号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "其中一个代号而已，暂时就这样叫我就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听你这么说，看来是你自己也没想好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "名字也许不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也对，看来你和我一样，见机行事混口饭吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是不是听到炮弹的声音了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走，46A，快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当了那么久佣兵，我还是第一次看到引导炮火的无人机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这年头那些无人机术师越来越难对付了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是早点发现，我们也不至于死那么多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "我在脚印上做了些伪装，希望能多争取点时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你还真是什么源石技艺都会啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可不可以帮我治疗下伤口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "抱歉，我没学习过医疗源石技艺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没事，我也就随便说说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "我们的医疗兵是第二个失踪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别在意，兄弟。常有的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是没有你，我早就被那帮库兰塔捅穿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "其他人没逃出来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看来是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但这也意味着，我们安全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你还走得动吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "没有问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就不休息了，集合点应该在前面不远，以我们的速度，再走一个小时左右就能到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这次啊，这次可真是站错队了，那帮领主开价那么高，我还以为是稳操胜券呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "结果几发炮弹掉下来，所有人都在往后跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜了那几个和我长期合作的兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "钱是到手了，命也交代了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你呢，46A，你也是被他们高价骗来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "我需要一些补给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈别说得这么文绉绉的。用命换钱，大家都一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "也在找人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "找人，在战场上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么人？家人还是仇人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "恩人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这可，太有意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然这看上去还挺像你的脾气，不过你想要在这样鬼地方找恩人，怕不是被骗了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "那个人救了我，而且——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了好了。听我一句劝，小心别被利用了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我刚没好意思说，你这家伙也够奇怪了。现在我可要提醒你了，你觉得卡兹戴尔的哪儿能找到你那个恩人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "搞不好那个人根本没有打算救你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想想看你给干过活的那些雇主、还有伙计，哪一个不是说翻脸就翻脸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也许见面以后，那人反手就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "没想到竟会出现这样的失误，完全没有注意到敌人的攻击。\n爆炸物？法术？\n耳鸣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "哈......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但是，不能死在这里。\n就算是看不见，就算是爬，也要活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "你总是能活下来，萨弗拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "不过我没想到，你能活到现在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "你和那些残渣不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "你能活到现在，我姑且认同你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "而我，也应当给你一个结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "面对过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "或是面对未来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萨弗拉虚弱地，握住了法杖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "这次，我可以跟着您吗，巨枭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "小伙子，该醒醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "老先生，您怎么在这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "今天别人都有事，只有你和老夫俩萨弗拉在这儿喝闷酒谈天说地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "想起来点没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "好，好像......是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "给，冰水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "多谢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "再揉揉眼睛两边，用力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "呵，呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "这是老夫年轻时醒酒的法子，效果怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "差不多了，多谢您，老先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "嚯，都是自己人，不用那么客气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "这是老夫的偏方，只对萨弗拉有用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "12F啊，你刚刚是梦见什么了吗，我看你好像身体绷得很紧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "啊，是做了个奇怪的梦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "只是，想到了一些过去的事情而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "告诉我，你叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "我......我没有名字，只有代号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "从今往后，你就跟着我好了。如我所说，会有更多的危险等着你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "能走到哪里，就看你自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "现在的你，已经死在这里了。今天是你的死期，也是你的诞辰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "嗯嗯，作为礼物，就由我来给你一个新的名字好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "今天是，3月3日......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "那，以后你就叫12F好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
